My 2025 Tesla Y is a great car. I never had a car before, but I rode many Teslas in Uber, mainly Model 3, which I didn't like because it felt cheap and shaky, and I got car sick, though I usually don't. The 2025 Tesla Y feels smooth, doesn't feel cheap, and I don't get car sick even as a passenger.

